      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's just... heavy. The silence is louder than the battle was. I keep looking at my sword, sitting there in the dust. It's the only thing that hasn't failed me. It's the only thing that feels real anymore. Like there's this quiet understanding between us. Everything else is a lie or a memory, but the steel... it's just there. Waiting.",
